filofant is an open source email and document indexing server with

a customizable webinterface like a web search engine.

It creates a fulltext index out of all archived emails and of documents

stored at network shares or ftp servers. This knowledge pool is

accessible based on different permissions by all members of

a workgroup or company.



Homepage: http://www.filofant.org

Online test at: http://watch.filofant.org 



Release 1.1.3:

Bugfixes/Minor enhancements

For this release we changed the template system to alter the

CSS inclusion and change link color off already seen objects.

Also the query statements are changed when only public

permission grous are availible. This leads to better

performance for this queries, too.



This releases includes bugfixes in the key generation which

fails in past releases when a reverse lookup of the hostname

was not possible. Minor errors in the admin frontents are

corrected.



Changes: 

http://sourceforge.net/project/shownotes.php?group_id=152346&release_id=452118



Download source package at: 

http://sourceforge.net/project/showfiles.php?group_id=152346



jakob kollmann, filofant.org

